{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>55歲視帝陳豪（阿Mo）事業有成，且愛妻又顧家，與老婆陳茵媺於2013年結婚，婚後育有三名小朋友，陳茵媺專心相夫教子，陳豪努力拍劇賺錢養家，他憑好男人形象一直人氣高企，除了拍劇也接了不少廣告，吸金力驚人。陳豪近來北上工作，他被發現獨自在機場過關，55歲狀態Fit到漏！</p><figure><img alt=\"陳茵媺與老公陳豪及子女慶祝生日。（IG@aimeechan_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260414/1120777493071007744837209.jpeg/P8l9C6j5ay7-XiWIecNKRum1zeUWOh5eLYFVRy2BVUc\"/><figcaption>陳茵媺與老公陳豪及子女慶祝生日。（IG@aimeechan_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳茵媺陳豪向來恩愛。（IG@aimeechan_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142094435161477120241853.jpeg/tY0igmcYqDL7qdDvOfFqbQPq4ZiTR_bKAOinIwDopyM\"/><figcaption>陳茵媺陳豪向來恩愛。（IG@aimeechan_official）</figcaption></figure><p>陳豪北上工作勁低調友善</p><p>日前有網民在社交平台分享在機場見到陳豪的照片。陳豪一身白衫灰褲，腳踏波鞋，孭住一個黑色背囊，手持口罩，一見到影迷即展現迷人笑容，態度友善親切。另一張相中，陳豪再豎起手指公打招呼。照片中的陳豪一人身處行李輸送帶，似乎是獨自一人北上工作，雖然家底豐厚，更是無綫公認吸金王，但陳豪絲毫沒架子。</p><figure><img alt=\"陳豪及陳茵媺（Aimee）一家人曾到加拿大旅行，一家五口玩得相當盡興。（IG：@aimeechan_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250820/1034830128347090944094326.jpeg/PRUgJgy4d-EqLv5cGKYp1hJ2bThzWvMGXWPE311jxN8\"/><figcaption>陳豪及陳茵媺（Aimee）一家人曾到加拿大旅行，一家五口玩得相當盡興。（IG：@aimeechan_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"圈中模範夫妻代表陳豪及陳茵媺（Aimee）。（IG：@aimeechan_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250820/1034830134135492608421956.jpeg/xEHhhJ9dKRD28aQd-_o8yJnnfl7ytUzUGJVCMxiVQjM\"/><figcaption>圈中模範夫妻代表陳豪及陳茵媺（Aimee）。（IG：@aimeechan_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"視帝陳豪專門北上拍片分享廣州老字號超記煲仔飯。（小紅書@陳豪）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260414/1120710201545068544465071.png/9cqB-WL-TIgfBHFo9OtkEqb2qleN_j0JnuN-J57jfic\"/><figcaption>視帝陳豪專門北上拍片分享廣州老字號超記煲仔飯。（小紅書@陳豪）</figcaption></figure><p>陳豪陳茵媺搬超豪地段中半山海景豪宅</p><p>陳豪長做長有，生活愈見富貴，去年有報道指陳豪陳茵媺一家人由淺水灣搬到超豪地段中半山豪宅，無敵海景盡收眼底。而去年初陳茵媺亦成功躋身豪門闊太圈子，常出席富婆飯局，與朱玲玲、翁嘉穗、劉倩婷大曬好交情，一家人身價不菲！</p><figure><img alt=\"陳豪北上工作。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188574043075383296497805.png/n4EyvcAvMUbPphaRO26dY3wqOf0szUVTX2R6zV9kes0\"/><figcaption>陳豪北上工作。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳豪見到影迷舉起手指公打招呼。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188574039883386880168932.png/U068hz8-H6oXll_QBAdcTpc4GeyZWcIeHNnsYBzZ7GA\"/><figcaption>陳豪見到影迷舉起手指公打招呼。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳茵媺榮登闊太飯局常駐成員！（IG@chomandylee）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250917/1044974296897687552627450.jpeg/j3JcqsYg80WyBGtM45tQIg34sD_8cR4tH8Gbuh_Bm7o\"/><figcaption>陳茵媺榮登闊太飯局常駐成員！（IG@chomandylee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳茵媺獲汪詩詩、汪圓圓（已改名蔡汪鎂庭）以及劉倩婷為她預祝生日。(陳茵媺ig)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260329/1114949038979420160863072.jpeg/S_2YFrLFC97THFyTEDnmMHLL0-Cu1kBo8OiGDfDohg0\"/><figcaption>陳茵媺獲汪詩詩、汪圓圓（已改名蔡汪鎂庭）以及劉倩婷為她預祝生日。(陳茵媺ig)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳茵媺獲汪詩詩、汪圓圓（已改名蔡汪鎂庭）以及劉倩婷為她預祝生日。(陳茵媺ig)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260329/1114949036307517440342190.jpeg/zyeG-bI8NmsAlUBGfYhGlHP4Bhbgd1vHReqVoUXqlaE\"/><figcaption>陳茵媺獲汪詩詩、汪圓圓（已改名蔡汪鎂庭）以及劉倩婷為她預祝生日。(陳茵媺ig)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳茵媺收到兩個蛋糕和一束鮮花。(陳茵媺ig)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260329/1114949031529943040726048.jpeg/B7GlLhdMssevvYZDAz4xbDke5oJnOLVZH_M5kB_zOZA\"/><figcaption>陳茵媺收到兩個蛋糕和一束鮮花。(陳茵媺ig)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳茵媺許願。(陳茵媺ig)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260329/1114949034017296384167825.jpeg/2GblWc3iAx4j7KlfQBg37ap1GYdWP4CjDcpyjQ3Kco0\"/><figcaption>陳茵媺許願。(陳茵媺ig)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"4月1日亦是2006年港姐冠軍陳茵媺（Aimee）的生日。（IG@aimeechan_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260402/1116363294332948480762958.jpeg/-lwVwxub6WRoKynD4cv4_PDIpKBU4Fan30MJ2N9DCdg\"/><figcaption>4月1日亦是2006年港姐冠軍陳茵媺（Aimee）的生日。（IG@aimeechan_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳茵媺曬巨鑽戒指！（IG@aimeechan_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260330/1115428376090382336864123.jpeg/PVT47GSMTWbj0K68xsiIWKMstUogDFRHW2KWCVtilgk\"/><figcaption>陳茵媺曬巨鑽戒指！（IG@aimeechan_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳茵媺分享「單人婚紗相」慶結婚13周年。（IG@aimeechan_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142094085750788096385214.jpeg/QiUzxP5WPBMpS-geQ7SE2gWFoDUYF3V1s9nOW7PZzls\"/><figcaption>陳茵媺分享「單人婚紗相」慶結婚13周年。（IG@aimeechan_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳茵媺分享「單人婚紗相」。（IG@aimeechan_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142094089232191488193524.jpeg/j4WOCok0tNDazAzIU8iVh21NW3_w2o5jRigvSkYoL0o\"/><figcaption>陳茵媺分享「單人婚紗相」。（IG@aimeechan_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳茵媺好美。（IG@aimeechan_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142094242861027328239457.jpeg/L9zJWgsOYJ8s3EfH_oQBB6FS5jkbwI_ZeP2mnnj9pp4\"/><figcaption>陳茵媺好美。（IG@aimeechan_official）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T04:19:07.612449+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1007,"images":17,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T04:00:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T06:57:52.699149+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T04:17:34.641461+00:00","content_hash":"36a751b0bc13b03dbddb88a795012d817cb7f37a629e5a6d38cef7dc27131259","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}